Hi John,

Change your last line to

res <- mirtCAT(mo = mod, local_pattern = pat)
               design = list(customNextItem=customNextItem))

without the df object. You've passed a pattern containing only integer values to be used as the responses to a set of questions with responses coded as strings. Hence, the pattern [0,1,0,...] can't be reasonably compared to c('154', '185', ....) in any meaningful way. HTH.

Phil

